{"id":"d6bcd07303c88c81","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-2gen-prop.md","title":"2-generic 的跳跃性质订正","display":"thm-2gen-prop — 2-generic 的跳跃性质订正","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-2gen-prop","aliases":["20-thm-2gen-prop"],"display":"thm-2gen-prop — 2-generic 的跳跃性质订正","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"local-extension","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.4；层级扩展的本地证明","source_pdf_pages":[172],"source_printed_pages":[138],"depends_on":["[[20-df-ngen]]","[[20-thm-1gen-low]]","[[20-thm-hierarchy-closure]]","[[20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-2gen-prop"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-2gen-prop</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-2gen-prop — 2-generic 的跳跃性质订正"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-extension"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.4；层级扩展的本地证明"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>172</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>138</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88fbecf58d4e0c66\" href=\"?note=88fbecf58d4e0c66\" title=\"20-df-ngen\">20-df-ngen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5b36efa5ca36c7bf\" href=\"?note=5b36efa5ca36c7bf\" title=\"20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump\">20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,2)\">\\(\\operatorname{nGeneric}(G,2)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 与其特征集合识别；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 是跳跃，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 为有效 join。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88fbecf58d4e0c66\" href=\"?note=88fbecf58d4e0c66\" title=\"20-df-ngen\">20-df-ngen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bc7d5064491f1d37\" href=\"?note=bc7d5064491f1d37\" title=\"20-thm-1gen-low\">20-thm-1gen-low</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0f7cd94927463198\" href=\"?note=0f7cd94927463198\" title=\"20-thm-hierarchy-closure\">20-thm-hierarchy-closure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5b36efa5ca36c7bf\" href=\"?note=5b36efa5ca36c7bf\" title=\"20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump\">20-thm-generic-not-lower-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}2gen\\text{-}prop}\\vdash\nG&#39;\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;,\\qquad G\\not\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}2gen\\text{-}prop}\\vdash\nG&#39;\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;,\\qquad G\\not\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>算术层级的包含关系给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 串集合亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span>，故 2-generic 是 1-generic；完整 GL1 证明给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。前一跳跃不可计算性定理取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=2\">\\(n=2\\)</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\not\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(G\\not\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。这两个结论使用不同依据，已经各自列为直接依赖。</p>\n<p>不把第二个结论擅自提升成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(G&#39;\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span>：2-generic 没有被假设位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_3\">\\(\\Delta_3\\)</span> 的某个固定度。这仍是原书 1-generic 讨论及本地 n-generic 定义的层级扩展。</p>\n<p>来源背景：印刷 138 / PDF 172。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-ngen","status":"resolved","id":"88fbecf58d4e0c66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-ngen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-1gen-low","status":"resolved","id":"bc7d5064491f1d37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-1gen-low]]","embed":false},{"